Disp.TitleLink=Clickable song title (YouTube search for artist + title)
Disp.OwnLink=Own link:

Cov.Enable=Show album cover in Discord
Cov.Info=Discord only shows covers that have a public URL. The cover of your file can be uploaded (x0.at needs no account) or looked up online (see "Sources"). Every cover is resolved once and cached.
Cov.Embedded=Cover in the tags (MP3 / FLAC / M4A)
Cov.Folder=Image in the track's folder
Cov.FolderNames=File names (;):
Cov.Upload=Upload covers to:
Cov.UploadOff=Off (online lookup only)
Cov.UploadCatbox=catbox.moe (no account)
Cov.UploadImgur=Imgur (Client-ID)
Cov.UploadX0=x0.at (no account)
Cov.ImgurId=Imgur Client-ID:
Cov.GetImgurId=Get ID
Cov.PreferLocal=Prefer the file's own cover
Cov.PublicNote=Uploaded covers can be seen by anyone who has the link.
Cov.ClearCache=Clear cover cache
Cov.Cleared=Cover cache cleared.
Cov.Current=Current cover:
Cov.OpenImage=Open image
Cov.Off=Covers are switched off – Discord shows the AIMP logo.
Cov.Nothing=Nothing is playing.
Cov.Searching=Looking for a cover…
Cov.None=No cover found – Discord shows the AIMP logo.
Cov.Source=Source: %1
Cov.SrcCache=cover cache
Cov.SrcOnline=found on %1
Cov.SrcEmbedded=from the file's tags
Cov.SrcFolder=image in the track's folder
Cov.SrcUploaded=%1, uploaded to %2

Src.Info=Online lookups search the artist / album and use the public image URL directly – nothing is uploaded. Sources are tried top to bottom, the first hit wins.
Src.Spotify=Spotify (needs a free developer app)
Src.CreateApp=Create app
Src.ClientId=Client ID:
Src.ClientSecret=Client Secret:
Src.Deezer=Deezer (no key)
Src.Itunes=Apple Music / iTunes (no key)
Src.Bandcamp=Bandcamp (no key, unofficial endpoint)
Src.Discogs=Discogs (needs a free personal access token)
Src.GetToken=Get token
Src.Token=Token:
Src.MusicBrainz=MusicBrainz + Cover Art Archive (no key)

